sxml transform: --initial-template needs an NCName or Q{uri}local
Usage: sxml transform [--initial-mode=NAME] [--initial-template=NAME] [--method=METHOD] [--param=NAME=VALUE]... [--result-directory=DIR] [--collection=DIR] [--code-language=LIBRARY]... [--locations=WHEN] [--output=FILE] [--force] STYLESHEET [INPUT]
Try 'sxml transform --help'.
